// Run on the Application Insights resource from app/app.json (Cronus Fragt's own telemetry, TelemetryScope::ExtensionPublisher).
// A polling round finished (CRF-0004, step 28) in which at least one shipment tracking record failed. The job queue entry itself stays green.
// In this repository the round event is CRF-0004; the workbook's text calls it CRF-0003, which here is "shipment created".
traces
| where timestamp > ago(1h)
| where tostring(customDimensions.eventId) == 'CRF-0004'
| where toint(customDimensions.alFailed) > 0
| project timestamp, message,
    succeeded = toint(customDimensions.alSucceeded),
    failed = toint(customDimensions.alFailed),
    companyName = tostring(customDimensions.companyName)
| order by timestamp desc
